1:["$","main",null,{"id":"main-content","children":[["$","$Ld",null,{"eyebrow":"Apply Tajweed while you recite","title":"Online Tajweed Classes","description":"Live one-to-one Tajweed classes for kids and adults who want clearer makharij, practical rule application and careful correction during Quran recitation.","compact":true,"children":[["$","$La",null,{"className":"button button-ivory","href":"/free-assessment/","children":["Book free assessment ",["$","$Lb",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$8:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right"}]]}],["$","$Le",null,{"className":"button button-ghost-light","children":[["$","$Lb",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":[["path",{"d":"M2.992 16.342a2 2 0 0 1 .094 1.167l-1.065 3.29a1 1 0 0 0 1.236 1.168l3.413-.998a2 2 0 0 1 1.099.092 10 10 0 1 0-4.777-4.719","key":"1sd12s"}]],"className":"lucide-message-circle"}]," Ask about this course"]}]]}],["$","$Lf",null,{"items":[{"name":"Home","href":"/"},{"name":"Courses","href":"/courses/"},{"name":"Online Tajweed Classes"}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"section section-paper","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"shell content-grid","children":[["$","article",null,{"className":"prose","children":[[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"Course overview"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"Learn Tajweed online through explanation and live correction"}],[["$","p","Knowing the name of a Tajweed rule is different from applying it while reading. A learner may understand an example in isolation but return to an old pronunciation habit when several words are joined in a verse. QuranCrest's online Tajweed classes therefore combine short explanations with recitation, listening and immediate correction.",{"children":"Knowing the name of a Tajweed rule is different from applying it while reading. A learner may understand an example in isolation but return to an old pronunciation habit when several words are joined in a verse. QuranCrest's online Tajweed classes therefore combine short explanations with recitation, listening and immediate correction."}],["$","p","The first assessment checks the learner's current reading, including letter articulation, common vowel patterns, pace and repeated mistakes. The tutor can then select a small number of priorities instead of presenting every rule at once. A reader with weak joining or letter recognition may first be advised to review Noorani Qaida or guided Quran Reading.",{"children":"The first assessment checks the learner's current reading, including letter articulation, common vowel patterns, pace and repeated mistakes. The tutor can then select a small number of priorities instead of presenting every rule at once. A reader with weak joining or letter recognition may first be advised to review Noorani Qaida or guided Quran Reading."}],["$","p","Lessons are live and one-to-one for children and adults. The learning path can include makharij, relevant letter qualities, rules that appear in the learner's passage, elongation, echoing sounds and careful stopping. The order and depth depend on the learner's starting level; this outline is a pathway rather than a fixed completion promise.",{"children":"Lessons are live and one-to-one for children and adults. The learning path can include makharij, relevant letter qualities, rules that appear in the learner's passage, elongation, echoing sounds and careful stopping. The order and depth depend on the learner's starting level; this outline is a pathway rather than a fixed completion promise."}]],["$","h2",null,{"children":"What the learner can work toward"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"outcome-grid","children":[["$","div","Identify recurring pronunciation and articulation mistakes",{"className":"outcome-item","children":["$L10"," ","Identify recurring pronunciation and articulation mistakes"]}],"$L11","$L12","$L13"]}],"$L14","$L15","$L16","$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b",["$L1c","$L1d"],false,"$L1e","$L1f","$L20","$L21","$L22","$L23"],"$L24","$L25"]}],"$L26"]}]}],"$L27","$L28","$L29"]}]
